    "title": "Nationwide Economic Boycott Promoted by The People's Union USA",
    "text": "• A nationwide economic boycott is scheduled for Friday by The People's Union USA.\n• The boycott is a 24-hour effort aimed at highlighting the influence of big money in America.\n• The organization is not a political party or a protest, but a movement focused on economic control.\n• Participants are encouraged to make only necessary purchases for 24 hours.\n• Guidance includes refraining from spending on fast food, gas, major retailers, and using credit or debit cards for nonessential purchases.\n• Group organizer John Schwarz stated that the boycott aims to remind people of their power.\n• Schwarz emphasized that the system is 'rigged' and that the movement is already making an impact.\n• The group plans to expand its boycotts with longer economic blockades targeting specific companies.",
